{"material_id": "ntce.zhongxue.jiaoyuzhishi.2019a.q30.material.recovered", "text": "材料： 初三学生晓辉近期很苦恼，感觉常常不能很好地控制自己的情绪，他觉得自己的情緒来得快，变得也快，在学校，取得好成绩时就非常高兴，遇到一点挫折又极度苦恼；与同学交往经常为一点儿小事发脾气，导致同学关系紧张。回到家里，只要父母过问他的学习，他就很抵触:“我都这么大了，还要你们管?”因此，与父母的关系也不融洽，他想改变这一切，可是每次出现状况时，老毛病就再次发作。他非常恨自己，每次发了脾气都后悔莫及，他不知该怎么办。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《教育知识与能力》（中学）真题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "3c14933709f0f97949b7eb104decf3e94a6ba1622df1e77a03f6c8261b7817da", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2451, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2660, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《教育知识与能力》（中学）真题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 30, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "3c14933709f0f97949b7eb104decf3e94a6ba1622df1e77a03f6c8261b7817da"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.zhongxue.jiaoyuzhishi.2019a.q30"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.zhongxue.jiaoyuzhishi.m4.k01", "ntce.zhongxue.jiaoyuzhishi.m5.k02"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.zhongxue.ability.care", "ntce.zhongxue.ability.theory"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.302.r006", "ntce.outline.302.r020", "ntce.outline.302.r030", "ntce.outline.302.r031"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.zhongxue.jiaoyuzhishi.2019a.q30"], "word_count": 209, "level": "zhongxue", "subject": "jiaoyuzhishi", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《教育知识与能力》（中学）真题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《教育知识与能力》（中学）真题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "3c14933709f0f97949b7eb104decf3e94a6ba1622df1e77a03f6c8261b7817da", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2451, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2660, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, 